The full brief lives at `docs/project-brief.md`. It is long (all
appendices included) and deliberately not loaded by default — read it
with the file tool when a task genuinely needs the original wording or
an appendix detail.

For day-to-day work, `Project_milestones.md` and `AGENTS.md` /
`general.mdc` already capture the team's translation of this brief into
current scope and build order. Only reach for the original when those
are ambiguous or you need to check exact instructor wording.
